      "side": 1,
      "message": "ShellEscape is necessary here, which is creating the command for the build action,  as it wraps the input paths with a single quote and thus prevents the $ sign being evaluated in shell. As the impact of this change is only limited to filepaths including $ sign, or potentially any filepaths containing [shell unsafe characters](https://source.corp.google.com/android/build/blueprint/proptools/escape.go;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1;l\u003d67?q\u003dshellEscapeList%20p:%5Eandroid$\u0026m\u003d100\u0026det\u003dmat\u0026type\u003dcs\u0026gsn\u003dshellUnsafeChar\u0026gs\u003dkythe%3A%2F%2Fgoogleplex-android.googlesource.com%2Fcodesearch%2Fandroid%3Flang%3Dgo%3Fpath%3Dbuild%2Fblueprint%2Fproptools%23func%2520shellUnsafeChar) passed via glob, any pathfiles not containing such characters will not be affected with this change.",
